Subject: [PATCH 102/954] feat(st-bsec): add driver for the new IP version
 BSEC3

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/arm-trusted-firmware.git de351ce73990e511ce96aa3aec51909c2285860c feat(st-bsec): add driver for the new IP version BSEC3]
Change-Id: I38ca0db22d06704769c994c6806ccd80b17dde6e
Signed-off-by: Nicolas Le Bayon <nicolas.le.bayon@st.com>
---
 drivers/st/bsec/bsec3.c        | 489 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 include/drivers/st/bsec.h      |  13 +-
 include/drivers/st/bsec3_reg.h | 103 +++++++
 3 files changed, 603 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
